//   mixed[j] = mean_h sigmoid(u[h*D + j]) * normed[h*D + j]       j < D
//   injp[row, tg, hh] = partial sum over this threadgroup of normed[i] * winj[hh, i]
// It exists so a FULL-PRECISION checkpoint keeps the fused chain: `fusedChainActive` used to demand
// 8-bit g64, so a bf16 hyper-connection silently fell back to nine MLX ops and cost +2.57 ms/token
